# docs/20 U15 on battery (review of the U15 fix): memo_cap with the cable out. The G0 press
# was 5 minutes ago, so before the fix the first tick after the cap turned the backlight
# off and the held screen was never seen; it also lost "saved" and the tip.
boot store=sd usb=off bat=4100 lang=zh
wait 1000
down g0
wait 600
mic 240000 2500
shot memo-4m  Memo, 4 min (on battery the screen dims while recording)
mic 61000 2500
shot memo-5m01  5:01, G0 still held: lit (dimmed), "5 min reached: saved" / Let go of [G0] / Longer? Let go, then Opt+R
mic 10000 2500
shot memo-5m11  5:11, still held: the same screen, not dark
up g0
wait 500
shot released  released: full light, back to the page
